  "objective": "Data 2026. Three curricula already written to disk — Data Analyst, Data Engineer, Analytics Engineer — are taken further rather than restarted. It begins at the roadmap: the language is rewritten, the roadmap is detailed, and objectives are written for the role, then each module, then each lesson. Those names and objectives are what drive the search for books, documents and video, and the run hands the author a list with a way to obtain each one, then waits. Nothing is read until the author has fetched the sources and said so. Lessons are composed against the objectives, the run stops for the author to approve the content, and the site build is handed over as commands rather than run.",
